	(text "Notes:\n	Requires test to see actual resistance on I2C Line\n	Both BMP and BNO specify 10K pull ups, we probably\n	only need 1 set, and maybe less than 10K\n\n	JLC PCB is out of stock of the BNO055 and has the price listed at double\n	it could be beneficial to order some from DigiKey, or desolder our adafrutit\n	ones and solder them ourselves\n\n	https://www.digikey.com/en/products/detail/bosch-sensortec/BNO055/6136301"
